<title>UK: Banco BMC $50 mln Eurobond due mid-May -lead.</title>
<headline>Banco BMC $50 mln Eurobond due mid-May -lead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Banco BMC will launch a $50 million eight-year Eurobond in mid-May, lead manager WestMerchant said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal will have puts and calls after three and five years, and market price expectations were for a yield of 380 to 410 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes, the statement said.</p>
<p>Banco BMC has completed investor presentations in London, Basel, Zurich and Geneva. The deal will be the first tranche to be launched under BMC's new $150 million Euro medium term note programme, WestMerchant said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
